    "detailed_description": "For the first time ever, you are able to immerse yourself in a world of milling.<br><br>Use a conventional milling machine to drill, mill, grind and cut.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787960/extras/2915ac24ea2e827f35909b4a9a1fb8e2.poster.avif?t=1748258635\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787960/extras/2915ac24ea2e827f35909b4a9a1fb8e2.webm?t=1748258635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787960/extras/2915ac24ea2e827f35909b4a9a1fb8e2.mp4?t=1748258635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Import your own blueprints, to prototype unique products in Free milling mode.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787960/extras/69c47acf0f73ef558a8c7c662cd00535.poster.avif?t=1748258635\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787960/extras/69c47acf0f73ef558a8c7c662cd00535.webm?t=1748258635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787960/extras/69c47acf0f73ef558a8c7c662cd00535.mp4?t=1748258635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Measure with precision and complete challenging tasks in Career mode.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787960/extras/42c83d7b920e790692daabab7bc41beb.poster.avif?t=1748258635\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787960/extras/42c83d7b920e790692daabab7bc41beb.webm?t=1748258635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787960/extras/42c83d7b920e790692daabab7bc41beb.mp4?t=1748258635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787960/extras/cf23a1abbc93e04f33856fe19141c84f.poster.avif?t=1748258635\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787960/extras/cf23a1abbc93e04f33856fe19141c84f.webm?t=1748258635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787960/extras/cf23a1abbc93e04f33856fe19141c84f.mp4?t=1748258635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Customize workpieces to fit your needs, by choosing materials and size.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787960/extras/55698203abcb6cd1f02e56cdcd3eedc3.poster.avif?t=1748258635\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787960/extras/55698203abcb6cd1f02e56cdcd3eedc3.webm?t=1748258635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787960/extras/55698203abcb6cd1f02e56cdcd3eedc3.mp4?t=1748258635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Get everything done with realistic physics and movement. And don't forget your cutting tools can break!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787960/extras/1a3d5d322cc903c35aef0e3aaddbc6e5.poster.avif?t=1748258635\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787960/extras/1a3d5d322cc903c35aef0e3aaddbc6e5.webm?t=1748258635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1787960/extras/1a3d5d322cc903c35aef0e3aaddbc6e5.mp4?t=1748258635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
